      "writtenOn": "2023-07-13T00:27:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The `per-file` syntax is mostly used and useful to define ownership based on a glob or on a file name recursively (in the current directory and all its subdirectories).\n\nI would prefer that we use OWNERS files in the normal way when possible (when we define ownership for a whole directory).\n\n\u003e the previous approach makes it a lot harder to figure out\n\nIsn\u0027t just searching for `OWNERS_fuzzers` in the whole tree enough to get this information ?",
      "parentUuid": "1a4a1d55_aa4030f0",
